<div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 720px">
  <h1 class="mb-4">About Crewsheet</h1>
  <p>
    Crewsheet is a small internal tool a handful of teams use to keep a shared
    staff directory: who's on the team, what they do, and a short bio. Every
    teammate can see the full roster and keep their own entry current.
  </p>
  <p>
    Built by a small ops team that got tired of an out-of-date spreadsheet.
    Questions or access requests go to whoever's listed as the team lead in
    the directory.
  </p>
